{"sha": "a08a1c83dcd1850bb1d7ef90eace867973534ea4d8f4f95c602e70ccd10c194e", "body": ["比较：由 $\\frac{\\ln t}{t} \\to 0$（在高中", "分册中已证明），取 $t = x^{\\alpha/\\beta}$：", "得 $\\frac{\\ln x}{x^{\\alpha/\\beta}} \\to 0$，再作", "$\\beta$ 次幂。对第二式，在第一式中取 $x = \\ln u$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[每位读者都应掌握的两个极限]\\label{ex:b1:functions:xx}", "求 $\\lim_{x \\to 0^+} x^x$ 与 $\\lim_{x \\to +\\infty}", "x^{1/x}$ 的值？两个幂都借助指数函数定义，因此", "应先处理指数：", "\\[", "x^x = \\eu^{x\\ln x}, \\qquad", "x\\ln x = -\\frac{\\ln(1/x)}{1/x} \\longrightarrow 0", "\\quad (x \\to 0^+),", "\\qquad\\text{从而 } x^x \\longrightarrow \\eu^0 = 1 ;", "\\]", "且 $x^{1/x} = \\eu^{(\\ln x)/x} \\to \\eu^0 = 1$，当 $x \\to +\\infty$", "时，直接由增长比较可得。要点在于：形如 $0^0$ 或 $\\infty^0$ 的不定型幂，", "\\emph{总是}借助", "改写 $u^v = \\eu^{v\\ln u}$ 并分析乘积 $v \\ln u$，", "--- 绝不靠分别观察底数与指数去猜测。", "决定两个极限的函数 $x \\mapsto \\frac{\\ln x}{x}$", "在本章的周末问题中被详尽研究。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=9.5cm, height=6cm,", "    xmin=0, xmax=5.2, ymin=-1.8, ymax=8.5,", "    xtick={1,2,3,4,5}, ytick={2,4,6,8}]", "  \\addplot[omMeth, thick, domain=0.02:5, samples=200] {ln(x)}", "    node[pos=0.97, below, font=\\small] {$\\ln x$};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:5, samples=100] {sqrt(x)}", "    node[pos=0.9, above, font=\\small] {$\\sqrt x$};", "  \\addplot[omProp, thick, domain=0:5] {x}", "    node[pos=0.72, left, font=\\small] {$x$};", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0:2.14, samples=120] {exp(x)}", "    node[pos=0.85, left, font=\\small] {$\\eu^x$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 下图示出", "\\cref{prop:b1:functions:powerrules} 所述的增长尺度：靠近右边缘时，", "$\\ln x$ 仅刚过 $1.6$，而 $\\eu^x$ 已移出画幅。每个比值", "（对数比幂、幂比指数）都趋于 $0$ ---", "图形只是暗示，证明中的代换才使之", "精确。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[幂与对数的常见误区]\\label{rem:b1:functions:pitfalls}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item \\emph{定义域。} 无理指数 $x^\\alpha$（$\\alpha$ 为无理数）要求", "        $x > 0$；$(-8)^{1/3}$ 最好避免，而改用“", "        $-8$ 的实立方根”，因为规则", "        $(x^\\alpha)^\\beta = x^{\\alpha\\beta}$ 在负数上悄然失效，", "        例如 $\\bigl((-8)^2\\bigr)^{1/6} = 2 \\neq -2$。", "  \\item \\emph{$\\sqrt{x^2} = \\abs x$}，而非 $x$：忘记", "        取绝对值是丢失负数解的", "        经典来源。", "  \\item \\emph{$\\ln(xy) = \\ln x + \\ln y$ 要求 $x, y > 0$。}对于", "        负的自变量，$\\ln(xy)$ 可以有定义，而", "        右端却无定义。", "  \\item \\emph{哪个函数增长？} 在 $x^\\alpha$ 中，", "        \\emph{底数}变化；在 $a^x$ 中则是\\emph{指数}变化。", "        二者的增长速度截然不同", "        （\\cref{prop:b1:functions:powerrules}），而混合型", "        表达式如 $x^{\\ln x}$ 或 $x^{1/x}$，", "        必须先改写为 $\\eu^{(\\cdot)}$ 再作任何推理 ---", "        如\\cref{ex:b1:functions:xx}所示。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{反三角函数}", "", "\\begin{definition}[$\\arcsin$、$\\arccos$、$\\arctan$]\\label{def:b1:functions:arc}", "下列限制", "\\[", "\\sin \\colon \\intcc{-\\tfrac\\pi2}{\\tfrac\\pi2} \\to \\intcc{-1}{1},", "\\qquad", "\\cos \\colon \\intcc{0}{\\pi} \\to \\intcc{-1}{1},", "\\qquad", "\\tan \\colon \\intoo{-\\tfrac\\pi2}{\\tfrac\\pi2} \\to \\R", "\\]", "都是严格单调的双射。其逆映射分别记作", "$\\arcsin$\\index{反正弦}、$\\arccos$\\index{反余弦}与", "$\\arctan$\\index{反正切}。例如，$y = \\arcsin x$", "（$x \\in \\intcc{-1}{1}$）是\\emph{唯一的}角，它位于", "$\\intcc{-\\frac\\pi2}{\\frac\\pi2}$ 中，其正弦为 $x$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=5.6cm, height=5.6cm,", "    xmin=-1.25, xmax=1.25, ymin=-1.8, ymax=1.8,", "    xtick={-1,1}, ytick={-1.5708,1.5708},", "    yticklabels={$-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$,$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, very thick, domain=-1:1, samples=200]", "    {rad(asin(x))};", "\\end{axis}", "\\begin{scope}[xshift=5.3cm]", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=5.6cm, height=5.6cm,", "    xmin=-1.25, xmax=1.25, ymin=-0.4, ymax=3.4,", "    xtick={-1,1}, ytick={1.5708,3.1416},", "    yticklabels={$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$,$\\pi$}]", "  \\addplot[omThm, very thick, domain=-1:1, samples=200]", "    {rad(acos(x))};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{scope}", "\\begin{scope}[xshift=10.6cm]", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=5.6cm, height=5.6cm,", "    xmin=-4, xmax=4, ymin=-1.9, ymax=1.9,", "    xtick={-2,2}, ytick={-1.5708,1.5708},", "    yticklabels={$-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$,$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$}]", "  \\addplot[omMeth, very thick, domain=-4:4, samples=200]", "    {rad(atan(x))};", "  \\addplot[dashed, gray, domain=-4:4] {1.5708};", "  \\addplot[dashed, gray, domain=-4:4] {-1.5708};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}